#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_invoice_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_invoice_id
msgid ""
"Original CUSTOMER invoice/note whose residual (in company currency) this "
"exchange difference Debit/Credit Note settles."
msgstr ""
"Factura/Nota original cuyo residual (en moneda de compañía) esta Nota de "
"Débito/Crédito de diferencial cambiario liquida."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
msgid ""
"Payment entry whose reconciliation against the source invoice originated "
"this exchange difference Debit/Credit Note. Used to tell apart the note from"
" a SPECIFIC partial payment from a note already issued for the same invoice "
"from an EARLIER partial payment -- an invoice paid in several installments "
"can accrue a distinct exchange difference note per installment."
msgstr ""
"Asiento de pago cuya conciliación contra la factura de origen generó esta "
"Nota de Débito/Crédito de diferencial cambiario. Se usa para distinguir la "
"nota de un pago parcial ESPECÍFICO de una nota ya emitida para la misma "
"factura por un pago parcial ANTERIOR -- una factura pagada en varias cuotas "
"puede acumular una nota de diferencial distinta por cada cuota."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_company__l10n_ve_exchange_note_pricelist_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ve_exchange_note_pricelist_id
msgid ""
"Pricelist used on exchange difference Debit/Credit Notes for CUSTOMER "
"invoices (`account_invoice_pricelist` requires every invoice/note to have "
"one whose currency matches the document's own currency). Must be in the "
"company's own currency -- these notes are always issued in company currency,"
" never in the partner's foreign pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Lista de precios usada en las Notas de Débito/Crédito de diferencial "
"cambiario para facturas de CLIENTE (`account_invoice_pricelist` exige que "
"toda factura/nota tenga una cuya moneda coincida con la del propio "
"documento). Debe estar en la moneda propia de la compañía -- estas notas "
"siempre se emiten en moneda de compañía, nunca en la lista de precios en "
"moneda extranjera del contacto."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.res_config_settings_view_form_inherit_l10n_ve_exchange
msgid ""
"Pricelist used on the Debit/Credit Note for CUSTOMER invoices (required by "
"account_invoice_pricelist). Must be in the company's own currency -- these "
"notes are always issued in company currency."
msgstr ""
"Lista de precios usada en la ND/NC de facturas de CLIENTE (requerida por "
"account_invoice_pricelist). Debe estar en la moneda propia de la compañía --"
" estas notas siempre se emiten en moneda de compañía."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_company__l10n_ve_exchange_note_product_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_res_config_settings__l10n_ve_exchange_note_product_id
msgid ""
"Product used as the line of exchange difference Debit/Credit Notes for "
"CUSTOMER invoices. Must be a service, its income and expense accounts must "
"be the company's exchange gain/loss accounts, and its sale tax must be the "
"default sale Exempt tax (l10n_ve_accountant: exent_aliquot_sale) -- the "
"exchange difference is not a VAT base, but l10n_ve_accountant requires a tax"
" on every line."
msgstr ""
"Producto usado como línea de las Notas de Débito/Crédito de diferencial "
"cambiario. Debe tener asignado el impuesto Exento de venta y de compra "
"(l10n_ve_accountant: exent_aliquot_sale / exent_aliquot_purchase) -- el "
"diferencial cambiario no es base de IVA, pero l10n_ve_accountant exige un "
"impuesto en cada línea."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.res_config_settings_view_form_inherit_l10n_ve_exchange
msgid ""
"Product used on the line of the Debit/Credit Note for CUSTOMER invoices. "
"Must have the sale and purchase Exempt tax configured."
msgstr ""
"Producto usado en la línea de la ND/NC de facturas de CLIENTE. Debe tener el"
" impuesto Exento de venta y de compra configurado."

