#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_journal__l10n_ve_exchange_debit_note_sequence_id
msgid ""
"Sequence used to number exchange difference Debit Notes. Configure the "
"prefix, padding, and periodicity from the sequence record itself."
msgstr ""
"Secuencia usada para numerar las Notas de Débito de diferencial cambiario. "
"Configure el prefijo, el relleno (padding) y la periodicidad desde el propio"
" registro de la secuencia."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_is_credit_note
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_is_credit_note
msgid ""
"Set when this note was created directly as a Credit Note (exchange gain), as"
" opposed to being the reversal of a Debit Note (see "
"`l10n_ve_exchange_original_id`)."
msgstr ""
"Se establece cuando esta nota fue creada directamente como Nota de Crédito "
"(ganancia cambiaria), a diferencia de ser una reversión de una Nota de "
"Débito (ver `l10n_ve_exchange_original_id`)."

#. module: l10n_ve_exchange_difference
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_ve_exchange_difference.field_account_move__l10n_ve_exchange_payment_id
